start: mr
R1: 3ch=dc 2ch {[3dc 2ch]x3 2ch 2dc}@ring ss@top # as written: "ch 2" after the bracket repeat gives a 4-ch last space
R2: ss@sp 3ch=dc 2ch 2dc@same [3dc@st {2dc 2ch 2dc}@corner]x3 3dc@st dc@same ss@top
R3: ss@sp 3ch=dc 2ch 2dc@same [7dc@st {2dc 2ch 2dc}@corner]x3 7dc@st dc@same ss@top
R4: ss@sp 3ch=dc 2ch 2dc@same [11dc@st {2dc 2ch 2dc}@corner]x3 11dc@st dc@same ss@top
